
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5200/api

### Get estimated drug levels currently in the body (semaglutide, tirzepatide, retatrutide)
GET {{baseUrl}}/levels
X-Api-Key: apikey

### Get the level time series for charting (shared time axis + one array per dosed drug)
GET {{baseUrl}}/levels/series
X-Api-Key: apikey
